### ============================================
### AUTH SERVICE TESTS
### ============================================

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:4001/health


### 2. /auth/me WITHOUT TOKEN
### Expected: 401
GET http://localhost:4001/auth/me


### 3. /auth/me WITH INVALID TOKEN
### Expected: 401
GET http://localhost:4001/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token


### ============================================
### LOGIN / FIREBASE
### ============================================

### IMPORTANT:
### Firebase authentication happens through Firebase.
### After login, copy the Firebase ID token and put it below.

@token = YOUR_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN


### 4. Get Current User
### Expected: 200
GET http://localhost:4001/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}